    <string name="hint_title">Using Comet with your remote</string>
    <string name="hint_body">• Press DOWN from the address bar or toolbar to enter the page.
• The D-pad then moves the pointer; press OK to click.
• Press BACK once to return to the address bar, then again to go back.
• Press the remote MENU key, or move right through the toolbar, for browser options.
• Long-press OK on a link or image for more options. If your remote can’t long-press, use Menu &gt; Link options.
• In a fullscreen video, press OK or the arrows to show the video controls.
• Too much typing? Menu &gt; Send from phone opens a link you send from your phone.</string>
